        "explanation": "Explanation:\nTest case 111: There is only 111 array: [1][1][1].\nTest case 222: There are 444 arrays as enlisted below:\n\n[1][1][1]\n[2][2][2]\n[1,2][1, 2][1,2]\n[2,1][2, 1][2,1]"
